    feat: add foundation for cloud agent work scheduling

    Implement mock foundation for scheduling agent work in the cloud:
    - Define `ScheduledWork`, `ScheduledWorkStatus`, and `ScheduledWorkTriggerType` domain models in `agentic-odi-core`.
    - Extend repository interfaces (in-memory & SQLite) and `ODIService` with methods to schedule, fetch, list, trigger, and cancel tasks.
    - Expose FastMCP tools for scheduled work (`schedule_work`, `get_scheduled_work`, `list_scheduled_work`, `cancel_scheduled_work`, `trigger_scheduled_work`).
    - Add `agentic-odi schedule` CLI command group and local/remote backend handlers.
    - Add studio sidecar API endpoints (`/api/schedule`) and `SchedulePanel` workspace surface in Living Studio (`apps/studio`).
    - Add comprehensive Python unit/contract tests and React/TypeScript tests.

    Co-authored-by: alehar9320 <5390430+alehar9320@users.noreply.github.com>

